{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29166","headline":"同韦少尹伤故卫尉李少卿 · 许浑","name":"同韦少尹伤故卫尉李少卿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客醉更长乐未穷，似知身世一宵空。\n香街宝马嘶残月，暖阁佳人哭晓风。\n未卷绣筵朱阁上，已开尘席画屏中。\n何须更赋山阳笛，寒月沈西水向东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29166.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29166","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}